        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Given the equation:\r\n\r\n    (A - B)/B = (C - D)/D\r\n\r\nSolve for C, using the following values:\r\n\r\nA: 73.0\nB: 67.4\nD: 299792.458\n\r\nOnce solved, calculate the percent difference between C and D.\r\n"
          ]
        },
