    "e087f2e0-f807-41ae-b702-057de0bd43af": {
      "id": "e087f2e0-f807-41ae-b702-057de0bd43af",
      "message": {
        "id": "e087f2e0-f807-41ae-b702-057de0bd43af",
        "author": {
          "role": "assistant",
          "name": null,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        "create_time": 1746362225.169851,
        "update_time": null,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "We are given the equation:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{A - B}{B} = \\frac{C - D}{D}\n\\]\n\nWe are to **solve for C** using:\n\n- \\( A = 73.0 \\)\n- \\( B = 67.4 \\)\n- \\( D = 299792.458 \\)\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Plug in the known values:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{73.0 - 67.4}{67.4} = \\frac{C - 299792.458}{299792.458}\n\\]\n\nCalculate the left-hand side:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{5.6}{67.4} \\approx 0.08310178\n\\]\n\nNow solve for \\( C \\):\n\n\\[\n\\frac{C - 299792.458}{299792.458} = 0.08310178\n\\]\n\nMultiply both sides by \\( 299792.458 \\):\n\n\\[\nC - 299792.458 = 0.08310178 \\times 299792.458 \\approx 24906.230\n\\]\n\nNow add \\( 299792.458 \\) to both sides:\n\n\\[\nC \\approx 299792.458 + 24906.230 = 324698.688\n\\]\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Calculate the percent difference between \\( C \\) and \\( D \\):\n\nThe percent difference is given by:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{|C - D|}{D} \\times 100 = \\frac{324698.688 - 299792.458}{299792.458} \\times 100\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= \\frac{24906.230}{299792.458} \\times 100 \\approx 8.310\\%\n\\]\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Final Answers:\n\n- \\( C \\approx \\boxed{324698.688} \\)\n- Percent difference ≈ **\\(\\boxed{8.31\\%}\\)**\n\nWould you like a plot to visualize this relationship?"
          ]
